  "notes": "{覗|のぞ}く is a godan verb meaning to peek, peep, or look into something.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Takes を for what you peek at/into\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {窓|まど}から{覗|のぞ}く: to peek through a window\n- {中|なか}を{覗|のぞ}く: to look inside\n- {顔|かお}を{覗|のぞ}かせる: to peek one's face in\n- {望遠鏡|ぼうえんきょう}を{覗|のぞ}く: to look through a telescope\n- ちょっと{覗|のぞ}く: to take a quick look\n\nHOMOPHONE (different kanji):\n- {除|のぞ}く: to remove, exclude, except\n\nCOMPOUND:\n- {覗|のぞ}き{込|こ}む: to peer into (more intently)",
